    <h1>Nonstop Flights: Dubai to New York</h1>
    <p>One of the world's great ultra-long-haul nonstop routes. Emirates connects Dubai International to JFK daily in approximately 13.5 hours, making it a flagship service for the airline and a bucket-list flight for aviation enthusiasts.</p>
